    "faq": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "battery": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How long does the battery last?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>It depends on the mode. In motion mode the light is only on for a few seconds at a time, so a charge typically lasts weeks. In always-on mode it is a matter of hours. Charge with the included USB-C cable; exact battery figures for each size are in the specs on the product page.</p>"
          }
        },
        "sensor": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How does the sensor work?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>A passive infrared sensor detects body heat moving in front of it and switches the light on. Once movement stops, the light turns itself off after the set delay. There is also an always-on mode and an off position for when you do not want it triggering.</p>"
          }
        },
        "wood": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Will it stick to wood?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes. The magnetic plate mounts with the adhesive strip on its back, which holds on painted wood, laminate, melamine and metal. Clean the surface, press firmly for 30 seconds and give the adhesive a few hours before hanging the light. On unfinished or oiled wood, wipe with rubbing alcohol first so the adhesive has a clean surface to grip.</p>"
          }
        },
        "delivery": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How long does delivery take?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Most orders arrive in 8–15 business days; the estimate at checkout is the real one. You get a tracking number by email as soon as the order ships, and you can check it any time on the <a href=\"/pages/track-order\" title=\"Track order\">Track order</a> page.</p>"
          }
        },
        "returns": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What if it is not right for my space?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Return it within 30 days of delivery for a refund. If a light develops a fault within 12 months, we replace it. Start either one from the <a href=\"/pages/contact\" title=\"Contact\">Contact</a> page with your order number.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
